<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('../partials/admin-head', { title: title }) %>
<style>
  .cols-form { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .cols-form label { margin: 0; }
  .cols-form select { min-width: 90px; }
  .ph-grid { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 26px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 14px; }
  .ph-card { background: var(--a-surface); border: 1px solid var(--a-border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
  .ph-card.hidden-photo { opacity: 0.6; }
  .ph-pic { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border-radius: 6px; overflow: hidden; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .ph-pic img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; }
  .ph-meta { font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--a-muted); }
  .ph-card form { margin: 0; }
  .ph-card input[type="text"] { width: 100%; margin: 0; font-size: 0.82rem; }
  .ph-row2 { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; }
  .ph-vis { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--a-muted); }
  .ph-vis input { margin: 0; width: auto; }
  .ph-tools { display: flex; gap: 4px; }
  .ph-tools button { min-width: 28px; }
  .danger { color: #d9534f; }
  /* Bulk-move toolbar. Sticks to the top so it stays reachable while you scroll
     a long grid picking photos. */
  .ph-bulk { position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 5; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap;
             margin: 0 0 12px; padding: 9px 12px; background: var(--a-surface); border: 1px solid var(--a-border); border-radius: 8px; }
  .ph-bulk[hidden] { display: none; }
  .ph-bulk-count { font-size: 0.85rem; min-width: 8.5em; }
  .ph-bulk-steps { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin: 0; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--a-muted); }
  .ph-bulk-steps input { width: 62px; margin: 0; }
  .ph-bulk-sep { flex: 1; }
  .ph-bulk-hint { font-size: 0.78rem; }
  .ph-bulk button[disabled] { opacity: 0.4; cursor: default; }
  .ph-pick { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--a-muted); cursor: pointer; }
  .ph-pick input { margin: 0; width: auto; }
  .ph-card.is-picked { outline: 2px solid #6ea8fe; outline-offset: 1px; }
</style>
</head>
<body class="admin">
<%- include('../partials/admin-topbar') %>
    <main class="admin-main">
        <p class="muted"><a href="/admin">← Dashboard</a></p>
        <h1>Photography</h1>
        <p class="muted">The photos on your <a href="/photography" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Photography page ↗</a>, reached from the “Photography” button in the Gallery and Gaussian Splats headers. They're laid out in rows that fill the page width — mixed portrait and landscape shots sit together at a matching height, never cropped. Newest uploads go to the top. Reorder one photo with its &uarr;&darr; arrows, or tick several and move them together with the bar above the grid.</p>
        <% if (saved) { %><div class="alert ok">Saved. <a href="/photography" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View page ↗</a></div><% } %>
        <% if (err === 'nofile') { %><div class="alert error">No images were added. Choose one or more image files.</div><% } %>
        <% if (err === 'upload') { %><div class="alert error">Something went wrong while saving those images. Please try again.</div><% } %>

        <div class="card-inset">
            <h3>Visibility</h3>
            <p class="muted" style="margin-top:-4px;">Switched off, the Photography button disappears from every header and the page itself returns a “not found” to visitors, so an old link or a search result can't reach it either. You stay able to open and edit it — the header keeps the button, marked <em>(hidden)</em>.</p>
            <form method="post" action="/admin/photography/visibility" class="cols-form">
                <label class="checkbox" style="margin:0;"><input type="checkbox" name="visible"<%= visible ? ' checked' : '' %>> Show Photography on the site</label>
                <button class="btn" type="submit">Save</button>
            </form>
            <% if (!visible) { %><p class="muted" style="margin:10px 0 0;color:#e0a33c;">Currently hidden from visitors.</p><% } %>
        </div>

        <div class="card-inset">
            <h3>Add photos</h3>
            <form method="post" action="/admin/photography" enctype="multipart/form-data">
                <label>Images <span class="muted">(you can select several at once)</span>
                    <input type="file" name="photos" accept="image/*" multiple required>
                </label>
                <button class="btn" type="submit">Upload</button>
            </form>
        </div>

        <div class="card-inset" style="margin-top:18px;">
            <h3>Layout</h3>
            <p class="muted" style="margin-top:-4px;">You compose the rows yourself: tick <strong>“End row after this photo”</strong> on any photo and the next one starts a new row. This setting is just the fallback — a row that isn't ended by hand breaks once it reaches this many photos.</p>
            <form method="post" action="/admin/photography/columns" class="cols-form">
                <label>Maximum photos per row
                    <select name="photography_columns">
                        <% for (var n = 1; n <= maxColumns; n++) { %>
                        <option value="<%= n %>" <%= columns === n ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= n %></option>
                        <% } %>
                    </select>
                </label>
                <button class="btn-link btn-sm" type="submit">Save layout</button>
                <span class="muted" style="font-size:0.82rem;">On narrower screens a row splits into more lines by itself, and photos stack on phones.</span>
            </form>
        </div>

        <h3 style="margin-top:26px;"><%= photos.length %> photo<%= photos.length === 1 ? '' : 's' %></h3>

        <%# Bulk reorder. Each card already contains its own forms, and forms
            cannot nest, so the tickboxes live in the cards but belong to this
            one through their form attribute. %>
        <form method="post" action="/admin/photography/move-selection" id="photoBulk" class="ph-bulk" hidden>
            <span class="ph-bulk-count" id="phCount">Nothing selected</span>
            <button class="btn-link btn-sm" type="submit" name="dir" value="up" data-needs-selection>Move up</button>
            <button class="btn-link btn-sm" type="submit" name="dir" value="down" data-needs-selection>Move down</button>
            <label class="ph-bulk-steps">by <input type="number" name="steps" value="1" min="1" max="999" aria-label="How many places to move"> place(s)</label>
            <span class="ph-bulk-sep"></span>
            <button class="btn-link btn-sm" type="button" id="phAll">Select all</button>
            <button class="btn-link btn-sm" type="button" id="phNone" data-needs-selection>Clear</button>
            <span class="muted ph-bulk-hint">Tick photos below &middot; shift-click for a run</span>
        </form>

        <ul class="ph-grid">
            <% photos.forEach(function (p) { %>
            <li class="ph-card<%= p.published ? '' : ' hidden-photo' %>">
                <label class="ph-pick" title="Select for moving several at once">
                    <input type="checkbox" name="ids" value="<%= p.id %>" form="photoBulk"<%= selected.indexOf(p.id) >= 0 ? ' checked' : '' %>>
                    <span>Select</span>
                </label>
                <div class="ph-pic"><img src="<%= p.image_path %>" alt="<%= p.title %>" loading="lazy"></div>
                <div class="ph-meta"><%= p.width && p.height ? p.width + ' × ' + p.height : 'size unknown' %></div>
                <form method="post" action="/admin/photography/<%= p.id %>">
                    <input type="text" name="title" value="<%= p.title %>" placeholder="Caption — shown under the photo (optional)">
                    <input type="text" name="date_text" value="<%= p.date_text || '' %>" placeholder="Date, e.g. 2024 or March 2024" style="margin-top:6px;">
                    <label class="ph-vis" style="margin-top:7px;"><input type="checkbox" name="row_break" <%= p.row_break ? 'checked' : '' %>> End row after this photo</label>
                    <div class="ph-row2" style="margin-top:7px;">
                        <label class="ph-vis"><input type="checkbox" name="published" <%= p.published ? 'checked' : '' %>> Visible</label>
                        <button class="btn-link btn-sm" type="submit">Save</button>
                    </div>
                </form>
                <div class="ph-row2">
                    <div class="ph-tools">
                        <form method="post" action="/admin/photography/<%= p.id %>/move" class="inline"><input type="hidden" name="dir" value="up"><button class="btn-link btn-sm" type="submit" title="Move up">↑</button></form>
                        <form method="post" action="/admin/photography/<%= p.id %>/move" class="inline"><input type="hidden" name="dir" value="down"><button class="btn-link btn-sm" type="submit" title="Move down">↓</button></form>
                    </div>
                    <form method="post" action="/admin/photography/<%= p.id %>/delete" class="inline" onsubmit="return confirm('Delete this photo? This also removes the file.');">
                        <button class="btn-link btn-sm danger" type="submit">Delete</button>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </li>
            <% }); %>
            <% if (!photos.length) { %><li class="muted">No photos yet — upload your first above.</li><% } %>
        </ul>
    </main>
    <script src="/js/admin-photography.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
